OL,3,ARepublican congressman's effort to
OL,4,Aimpeach US Defence Secretary Pete
OL,5,AHegseth fails, for now
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US House of Representatives votes
OL,8,Fto send a Republican congressman's
OL,9,Feffort to impeach Defence Secretary
OL,10,FPete Hegseth to committee - which could
OL,11,Feffectively end the attempt for now
OL,13,FThe measure accused Hegseth of waging
OL,14,Fwar on Iran without congressional
OL,15,Fauthorisation
OL,17,FSpeaking at the Pentagon for the first
OL,18,Ftime in six months, the defence
OL,19,Fsecretary called the impeachment effort
OL,20,Fa "farce" and added: "This is sabotage"
